<title>UK: Airtous buys U.S. tour operator.</title>
<headline>Airtous buys U.S. tour operator.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British travel company Airtours plc said on Monday its U.S. subsidiary, Sunquest Holdings Inc., has acquired all the issued share capital of ST Pacific Holdings Inc., a tour operator which trades as Suntrips from its base in San Jose, California, for about 12.3 million pounds ($20.1 million).</p>
</text>
